hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18050","Yaqub narrated to us, my father narrated to us from Ibn Ishaq, then al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah ibn Qays ibn Makhramah ibn al-Muttalib ibn Abd Manaf narrated to me from his father from his grandfather Qays ibn Makhramah, he said: I was born, I and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), in the Year of the Elephant, so we are the same age, we were born a single birth."
